{"entries":[[10775,"tweed","noun",3,"/twid/","m","",[["tweed","",["uncountable"],[],[]]],{},[],["Elle portait une jupe de tweed et un cardigan en shetland.","Il avait plus de style, avec son cartable de facteur en cuir élimé et son béret en tweed – comme quoi, la mode vintage ne date pas d'hier.","C'était un garçon que l'on pouvait montrer avec quelque fierté, vêtu de son tweed de bonne étoffe, toujours propre et dont il prenait grand soin."]],[23495,"twist","noun",1,"/twist/","m",[18950,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-twist.wav.mp3"],[["twist (dance)","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"twists"},[],["Servez-moi un twist.","Plus tard ils iront danser Danser le twist Comme tous les touristes Et tous les artistes De Saint-Tropez.","Le madison fait partie des nombreuses danses en ligne créées dans les années 60 comme le twist, le hully-gully ou la pachanga."]],[30394,"twister","verb",1,"/twis.te/","",[24575,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-twister.wav.mp3"],[["to dance the twist, to twist","",[],[],[]]],{"infinitive":"twister","auxiliary":"avoir","present_participle":"twistant","past_participle":"twisté","present":["twiste","twistes","twiste","twistons","twistez","twistent"],"imperfect":["twistais","twistais","twistait","twistions","twistiez","twistaient"],"future":["twisterai","twisteras","twistera","twisterons","twisterez","twisteront"],"conditional":["twisterais","twisterais","twisterait","twisterions","twisteriez","twisteraient"],"subjunctive":["twiste","twistes","twiste","twistions","twistiez","twistent"]},[],["Il se réinvente, se transpose, se décline, se twiste à l'infini."]],[38866,"Twa","noun",0,"/twa/","mf","",[["Twa","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"Twas"},[],""],[84068,"twa","adjective",0,"/twa/","mf","",[["Twa","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"twa","masculine_plural":"twas"},[],""],[84069,"twainien","adjective",0,"","","",[["Twainian","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"twainien","feminine":"twainienne","masculine_plural":"twainiens","feminine_plural":"twainiennes"},[],""],[84070,"tweet","n